{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in the depths of a dying planet. Play as a mysterious green cube, the last spark of life in an agonizing ecosystem. An ancient civilization dug too deep, polluted too much, and awakened a malevolent force... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal?\u00a0</strong>Emerge from your hiding place to fight this force, cross the remnants of this forgotten and heavily trapped world, and plunge into the heart of evil to eradicate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/77a26a632688b2252bd8b81f2b8c7dbf.poster.avif?t=1772136610\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/77a26a632688b2252bd8b81f2b8c7dbf.webm?t=1772136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/77a26a632688b2252bd8b81f2b8c7dbf.mp4?t=1772136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf11 Survive the traps of the Shadow </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world ruled by an entity that adapts to destroy you. In each chapter, it changes the rules of the game: reduced vision in the depths, deadly projectiles, asphyxiation, or even a dark clone tracking your every move. Never stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/bf3a1fb95a1e881c89529e7a3e91e86c.poster.avif?t=1772136610\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/bf3a1fb95a1e881c89529e7a3e91e86c.webm?t=1772136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/bf3a1fb95a1e881c89529e7a3e91e86c.mp4?t=1772136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca7 Explore a ruined world told in silence </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From abandoned underground mines to toxic industrial swamps, travel through 5 chapters with a heavy, melancholic atmosphere. No long speeches here: the tragic history of the ancient builders is discovered through the remnants they left behind and the details of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/353fbadf4bf9bd97dd79ab570734efed.poster.avif?t=1772136610\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/353fbadf4bf9bd97dd79ab570734efed.webm?t=1772136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/extras/353fbadf4bf9bd97dd79ab570734efed.mp4?t=1772136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f Nature strikes back </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are small, but you are not defenseless. Master precise 2D platforming gameplay, use your double jump to dodge danger, and find refuge near nature's last purifying molecules. Every effort counts to spread peace!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3474710?t=1772136610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474710/97f615b9bc9dd86be8c91e6cc931eaee58df94a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772136610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps